=== sig-capture-after-positional
from: BDD::Behave 0.9.5 lib/BDD/Behave.rakumod:333
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: param |capture
--- code
my %matchers;
sub matcher(Str:D $name, |c) {
    %matchers{$name} = c;
    "$name: {c.list.elems} positional, {c.hash.keys.sort.join(',')}"
}
